    {
      "id": "item_63",
      "command": "/bin/sh -lc \"cd /workspace/solution && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nwith open('method.py', 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\n# Update docstring\ncontent = content.replace(\n    '\\\"\\\"\\\"Method v59: Signed log-ratio power modulation for BOTH up and down genes.\\\\n\\\\nv39 baseline: Dev MSE = 0.001871, Score = 0.4882\\\\nv56 baseline: Dev MSE = 0.001607, Score = 0.5604\\\\nv59: Add RATIO_MOD_DOWN = 0.01 on top of v56 best (RATIO_MOD_UP=0.03)\\\\n  - Isolates effect of down-ratio modulation from up-ratio reduction\\\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"',\n    '\\\"\\\"\\\"v69: Asymmetric ratio modulation (different strength for ratio>1 vs ratio<1).\\\\n\\\\nv39 baseline: Dev MSE = 0.001871, Score = 0.4882\\\\nv56 baseline: Dev MSE = 0.001607, Score = 0.5604\\\\nv59: Add RATIO_MOD_DOWN = 0.01 on top of v56 best (RATIO_MOD_UP=0.03)\\\\nv67 best: RATIO_MOD_UP=0.035, MSE=0.001591\\\\nv69: Split RATIO_MOD_UP into pos/neg (asymmetric log-ratio modulation)\\\\n  - RATIO_MOD_UP_POS applies when log2_ratio > 0 (target > ref)\\\\n  - RATIO_MOD_UP_NEG applies when log2_ratio < 0 (target < ref)\\\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"'\n)\n\n# Replace RATIO_MOD_UP = 0.035 with two asymmetric constants\ncontent = content.replace(\n    'RATIO_MOD_UP = 0.035',\n    'RATIO_MOD_UP_POS = 0.050\\\\nRATIO_MOD_UP_NEG = 0.020'\n)\n\n# Replace the up_pow_gene ratio modulation line\ncontent = content.replace(\n    '    up_pow_gene = up_pow_gene + RATIO_MOD_UP * log2_ratio',\n    '    up_pos_mask = log2_ratio > 0\\\\n    up_pow_gene = up_pow_gene + np.where(up_pos_mask, RATIO_MOD_UP_POS, RATIO_MOD_UP_NEG) * log2_ratio'\n)\n\nwith open('method.py', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(content)\n\nprint(\\\"Done\\\")\nprint(f\\\"File size: {len(content)} bytes\\\")\nPYEOF\"",
      "original_command_sha256": "73a43d54c2670dbc3c0cfe243f82298887f1768ae7edae6d802a6b91fe816c1f",
      "command_email_identifiers_redacted": true,
      "exit_code": 0,
      "output_sha256": "d2c92a681ca3cbd0bd839ec5f8d3efa74308a901363aeb61b6215a71c7a30118",
      "output_characters": 27
